+# Approval Packet Template
+
+Use this template for final candidates routed to `#social-approvals`.
+
+Status: template only. It does not approve publishing.
+
+## Approval Request
+
+Platform:
+
+Profile / Brand:
+
+Business lane:
+
+Candidate:
+
+Source pack:
+
+Proposed publish window:
+
+Status: draft candidate only. Not published or scheduled.
+
+## Final Post Copy
+
+```text
+<final platform copy>
+```
+
+## Media
+
+| Asset | Path / Link | Status |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Deck PDF |  |  |
+| Cover preview |  |  |
+| Image sequence |  |  |
+| Source HTML/SVG/Figma/Canva |  |  |
+
+## Claim Risk
+
+Risk level: Low / Medium / High
+
+Why:
+
+Source links:
+
+- 
+
+Claims to soften or remove:
+
+- 
+
+## AI Disclosure
+
+AI-assisted assets used: Yes / No
+
+Disclosure needed for platform policy or audience trust: Yes / No / Unsure
+
+Notes:
+
+## Visual QA
+
+Score: `/30`
+
+Strongest element:
+
+Weakest element:
+
+Inspection notes:
+
+- exact text checked outside generator:
+- mobile readability checked:
+- no private data:
+- no fake logos/product UI:
+- crop/aspect ratio checked:
+
+## Approval Boundary
+
+Agents may prepare files, proof, variants, and internal routing.
+
+Do not publish, schedule, message customers/partners, deploy, merge, spend,
+change access, transfer domains, or start Hermes gateways unless Frank replies
+with explicit approval.
+
+## Decision Needed
+
+Reply with one:
+
+- `APPROVE`
+- `APPROVE WITH EDITS: <edit>`
+- `REVISE: <reason>`
+- `HOLD`
+
+## Slack Summary
+
+```text
+*Approval: <candidate title>*
+
+Brand:
+Platform:
+Status: draft candidate only, not published or scheduled
+Pack:
+
+*Media*
+- Deck:
+- Cover:
+
+*Post angle*
+<one paragraph>
+
+*Claim risk*
+<low/medium/high + why>
+
+*QA*
+Score: /30
+Notes:
+
+*Needed decision*
+APPROVE, APPROVE WITH EDITS, REVISE, or HOLD.
+```
